Hey everyone. I just wanted to share a project I have been putting a lot of time into lately. It is a free educational app called Smart Madiyan. I actually built this specifically for people in Kerala who are preparing for teaching exams like KTET LPSA and UPSA. Studying can be super boring sometimes so I wanted to make something that actually helps you practice easily right from your phone. You can find everything about it on my official website at https://smartmadiyan.blogspot.com. The app covers the full SCERT syllabus and even has a live study room feature where you can compete with other students. I honestly think practicing with real previous year papers makes a huge difference. I set up this repository to share updates and keep track of my development journey. Go ahead and visit the website if you want to download the app and try it out yourself. Let me know what you think.
